-- GPK custom: Open-world NM auto-spawner
--
-- Force-spawns every open-world Notorious Monster (mobType NOTORIOUS 0x02, excluding
-- battlefield/event mobs and instanced-content zones) and sets each to re-pop 5 minutes
-- after it is killed (SpawnMob arg3 = m_RespawnTime). ~3792 NMs.
--
-- Runs ONCE per server lifetime, on the first real login (module-level flag; resets on
-- restart). Every SpawnMob is pcall-wrapped so nothing here can break a login. If this
-- overloads the server, remove the 'custom/lua/nm_spawner.lua' line from modules/init.txt
-- and restart -- fully reversible.
-----------------------------------
